{"id": "project-wreckless-insider-debt", "title": "A $1M City grant, $118,000 of reported revenue and a growing insider debt", "seconds": 142.7, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "e689bb2a7f8f3f7f", "words": 451, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]", "established[4]"], "text": "Project Wreckless is a small San Francisco nonprofit. It teaches young people by restoring classic cars.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.58, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "van", "label": "Project Wreckless", "sub": "teaches young people by restoring classic cars"}, "wt": [0.33, 0.47, 0.98, 1.1, 1.19, 1.53, 1.78, 2.25, 2.96, 3.13, 3.4, 3.6, 3.9, 4.08, 4.54, 4.91]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[1]"], "text": "In 2024, the City’s Human Rights Commission gave it a grant of 1 million dollars.", "t0": 5.7, "t1": 9.97, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Human Rights Commission grant", "sub": "May 30, 2024 to July 30, 2025", "chip": "$1,000,000"}, "emph": ["1 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.29, 1.08, 1.17, 1.44, 1.7, 1.9, 2.29, 2.44, 2.57, 2.64, 2.91, 3.05, 3.25, 3.66]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[1]"], "text": "How much did the City then pay out?", "t0": 10.09, "t1": 11.79, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Human Rights Commission grant", "sub": "May 30, 2024 to July 30, 2025", "chip": "$1,000,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.26, 0.34, 0.48, 0.68, 0.87, 1.02]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "amount"], "text": "977,068 dollars.", "t0": 11.79, "t1": 14.41, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$977,068", "label": "14 vouchers, fiscal 2025 and 2026"}, "emph": ["977,068"], "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.51, 1.11, 1.54, 2.07]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat"], "text": "This is a lead,